    47	
    48	/-! ### Lemma 3 (exact collision mod p)
    49	
    50	Notation of the note: the base `x` (= 2), `M = L/ℓ²`, `u = x^M`, `γ = x^L = u^{ℓ²}`.
    51	The class lock (Lemma 1) gives an integer `g` with `ℓ² g = B p + A q − c`. -/
    52	
    53	/-- **Lemma 3, core.** If `ℓ² g = B p + A q − c` then `u^(B + A N − c) = γ^g` modulo `p`,
    54	where `u = x^M` and `γ = x^(M ℓ²)`, for any unit `x` mod `p`. No order hypothesis. -/
    55	theorem lemma3_core (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (x : (ZMod p)ˣ) (M A B q c ℓ g : ℤ)
    56	    (hg : ℓ ^ 2 * g = B * p + A * q - c) :
    57	    (x ^ M) ^ (B + A * (p * q) - c) = (x ^ (M * ℓ ^ 2)) ^ g := by
    58	  rw [← zpow_mul, ← zpow_mul]
